    <ol>
      <li>Copy <strong>{{ provider.primaryCode }}</strong></li>
      <li>Pick a country, regional, or global data plan on RedteaGO, checking for a "Calls/Texts Available" label if you need a working number</li>
      <li>Paste the code in the promo field at checkout and confirm the 5% price drop before paying</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="content-note">Discount shows before payment is completed.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Decision help -->
  <h2>Is RedteaGO the Right Pick for Your Trip</h2>
  <div class="decision-grid">
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--good">
      <h3>Good fit</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You want the lowest realistic starting price on a data-only eSIM and are happy to check the actual GB before buying</li>
        <li>You want to hotspot a laptop or tablet off your phone's data, supported everywhere RedteaGO operates</li>
        <li>You're fine buying data upfront and not getting a refund on unused top-ups once a plan is activated</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="decision-card decision-card--alt">
      <h3>Consider alternatives</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>You specifically need a real phone number for calls and texts, not just data: see <a href="/simlocal/">SimLocal</a>, whose UK plans include a full UK number for calls and texts (we bought one and confirmed it), rather than RedteaGO's labeled add-on approach</li>
        <li>You'd rather pay one flat price for unlimited data than track GB buckets: see <a href="/holafly/">Holafly</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Savings examples -->
