    <p class="content-note">5% is a modest discount rate compared to some other providers on this site, but RedteaGO's underlying per-GB price is already low enough that it can still beat a bigger percentage off a pricier competitor. Do the math on the actual plan you want rather than assuming the biggest percentage wins.</p>
